/*
 * Renode platform definition for STM32H753XI (Nucleo-H753ZI)
 *
 * Builds on Renode's own maintained STM32H743/H753 platform description
 * (platforms/cpus/stm32h753.repl, shipped with Renode), which provides the
 * CPU core, NVIC/EXTI interrupt routing, RCC, flash and all peripherals with
 * correct register addresses. This project only needs the peripherals it
 * actually drives, so this file just documents which shipped names those
 * correspond to.
 *
 * Peripherals used by this firmware (see drone_simulation.resc):
 *   uart4    @ 0x40004C00  -> debug / telemetry console
 *   timer2   @ 0x40000000  -> PWM motor outputs
 *   i2c1     @ 0x40005400  -> MPU6050 IMU
 *   adcM1S2  @ 0x40022000  -> battery voltage (ADC1)
 *   gpioPortA..gpioPortK    -> LEDs, button, motor PWM AF
 */

using "platforms/cpus/stm32h753.repl"
